#
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: Date Everything - Traduction FR\n"
"Language: fr\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
"Plural-Forms: nplurals=2; plural=(n > 1);\n"

#: koa_couch/1
msgctxt "Tag Nom d'objet (MAJUSCULES)"
msgid "COUCH"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Seated in your living room is a being who seems to truly embody the concept of comfort. His arms are draped over the back of the couch, his head tilted back and his eyes beginning to flutter shut."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/14
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He looks just as though he's about to fall asleep, but when he sees you approaching he shakes it off, looking up at you with a sweet smile."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/22
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Hello!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/30/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I hope I didn't wake you."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/31/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You look so cozy."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Mind if I join you?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Don't worry, I hadn't fallen asleep yet."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "You oughta come get in on this too."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/c-1/7/b/1
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Join me!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/c-1/8/b/1
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Thanks buddy! So do you in that fantastic red shirt."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "No way, please do!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He pats the seat next to him."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Come on and take a load off."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I'm Koa, by the way."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-0/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nice to meet you."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-0/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're my couch?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-0/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A pleasure."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-0/c-3/7 koa_couch/Koa_3/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "You too!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Sure am!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Hey, thanks!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Most everyone would continue the conversation from here, but Koa only closes his eyes, sighing pleasantly."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-1/27
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You wait for him to say something, but all you can hear is his quiet breathing."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-1/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Did you want to be alone?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-1/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I thought you were gonna talk to me..."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-1/37/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So... how about the"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-1/37/s/5
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "sports team?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "No no, that's okay."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Oh, sorry."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I'm not really a sports kinda couch."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Koa opens one eye, but he doesn't move."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I just thought you might like to share in all this comfort, you know?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-2/13
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Couch culture is really all about takin' it easy together."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-2/21
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "You know like... you ever heard people talk about 'alone together'?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-2/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, I love that."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-2/30/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's that mean?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-2/31/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure, it's like loving someone but leaving them alone. Kinda sus."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Right on, right on! You get it then."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-2/c-9/15
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I wish more people understood the beauty of alone together."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-2/c-10/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "It's kinda more a feeling than anything else, but..."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-2/c-11/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "How can you hate that? Alone together is such a beautiful concept..."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "It means you can be at peace with another being without even saying a word."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "It means not forcing a conversation or an activity between the two of you."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "It means just enjoying the moment without any expectations."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-3/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He sighs pleasantly, closing his eyes."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-3/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Guess I'll give it a shot then."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-3/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds boring."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-3/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can't you just tell me something about yourself?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-3/c-12/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Beautiful. You'll see."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-3/c-13/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "It isn't, I'm telling you."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-3/c-13/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just talk to me."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-3/c-13/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll just take your word for it then... let's try it out."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-3/c-14/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I... really don't want to ruin the mood, you know?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-3/c-14/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just do it."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-3/c-14/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I won't push you then."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-3/c-14/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Thanks for understanding, buddy."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Koa breathes in deep, sighing pleasantly. When he relaxes the entire room seems to relax with him—you find yourself growing sleepier alongside him."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-4/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You're not sure how much time passes as the two of you sit side by side in companionable silence, but it's certainly a good while."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-4/16
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Thanks for keeping it chill, buddy. This was real nice."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-4/27
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Got something I wanna give ya."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-4/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is this my pocket change?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-4/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Whoah, free money!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-4/37/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Did you steal this from me?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-4/c-15/7 koa_couch/Koa_3/0/g-0/c-3/7 koa_couch/Koa_5/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "You know it!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-4/c-16/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "It's not free, it's your money!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-4/c-17/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Steal?! No way!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-4/c-17/15
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I'm gonna pretend you didn't say that... 'cause that would REALLY harsh the vibe."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "You know in couch culture we're not big on expressing ourselves verbally."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "We prefer to let our actions speak for us. And a gift like this... it's just a way of honoring our friendship."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-5/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "In human culture giving someone stuff you found is deeply rude."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-5/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm touched you'd share your culture with me."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-5/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Interesting..."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-5/c-18/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Oh no! Huge bummer!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-5/c-18/15
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Good thing you know about couch culture now... now you'll know just what I mean."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-5/c-19/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I'm just glad you appreciate it."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-5/c-20/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Yeah, I think so, too."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-6/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Koa yawns."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-6/11
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I'm gonna take a nap... feel free to stick around as long as you want, alright?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_1/0/g-6/19
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I'm just so... comfy... Hmm... Zzzzzzz...."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_1/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Koa sighs, clearly burdened."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_1/0/11
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I've been feeling a little down lately... a lot of our friends around the house just have so much going on."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_1/0/19
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I wanna help, but hugs and a shoulder to cry on only go so far."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_1/0/27
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Now that you're here talkin' to all of us I hope maybe you can give them a different perspective than I can."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_1/0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure, I'll be happy to help."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_1/0/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't count out your own efforts, dude."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_1/0/37/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's not my job to play therapist to furniture."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_1/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Glad to hear it."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_1/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "...if you say so."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_1/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "...no, guess it's not."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_1/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Thanks for listening. I think I'm gonna take a nap."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_1/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Stay as long as you like, okay? Keep it comfy."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_2/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Koa gives you a friendly wave, patting the couch next to him."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_2/0/14
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Hey buddy! Come over. Take a load off."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_2/0/22/s/0 koa_couch/Koa_2/0/g-2/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thanks!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_2/0/23/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You in the mood to talk today?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_2/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't really need an invite to my own couch."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_2/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "No worries! Just come get comfy."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_2/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Am I ever?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_2/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Guess not! But you should sit anyway!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_2/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You take a seat next to Koa, and even though he says nothing you can tell that he seems happier just to have you here."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_2/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He closes his eyes, a small smile on his face."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_2/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Still not trying to talk huh..."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_2/0/g-0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So what's going on with you today?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_2/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "If you don't mind, yeah! Just wanna enjoy this moment..."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_2/0/g-0/c-4/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ah... I love moments like these. Don't you?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_2/0/g-0/c-4/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Okay..."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_2/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Neither of you says anything—somehow, the longer the silence stretches on, the more comfortable things feel."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_2/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Physically you're on your couch, but mentally you're at a Hawaiian beach, listening to the waves lap against the shore."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_2/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Koa is practically radiating comfortable satisfaction, and the happier he is, the happier you find yourself in turn."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_2/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Beautiful. Just beautiful."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_2/0/g-1/32
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Thanks for sharing the vibes today, buddy."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_2/0/g-1/40
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Now before you go... or I fall asleep..."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_2/0/g-1/51
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I got something for you."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_2/0/g-1/59/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You found my car keys!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_2/0/g-1/60/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A NEW CAR?!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_2/0/g-1/61/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What the hell are you doing with my keys?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_2/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Sure did!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_2/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Whoah whoah, no! This is your old car!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_2/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I'm not doin' anything with 'em! They fell into my cushions!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_2/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "You haven't really been goin' anywhere so I wasn't rushin' to find you and give 'em back."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_2/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "But us being cool... felt like you should have 'em back now."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_2/0/g-2/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can you not hold onto important things like this in the future?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_2/0/g-2/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Glad I can rely on you to help with this stuff."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_2/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "No worries, buddy!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_2/0/g-2/c-10/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "You got it."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_2/0/g-2/c-11/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Always!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_2/0/g-3/3
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Man, sittin' here with you really just puts me at ease."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_2/0/g-3/11
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I'm gonna get some shuteye... if you wanna stick around feel free!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_2/0/g-3/19
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Thanks for sharin' the silence with me."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_2/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Koa sighs deeply. It seems like you're really harshing his comfortable vibes."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_2/0/11
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Well... you know. Just been doing my best to keep my mind clear."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_2/0/19
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "You get to talking too much and it just brings up all the worst kinds of things."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_2/0/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Like what?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_2/0/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Talking is good for you though."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_2/0/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Come on, you can trust me..."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_2/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Please... just respect that I don't wanna get into it, alright?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_2/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I've said enough for today anyway."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_2/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I'm gonna take a nap, alright? Don't worry about waking me when you go."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_2/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He closes his eyes, and while you can tell he's not really asleep, it's clear that he has nothing more to say."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_3/0/6
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Hey hey! Come get comfy!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_3/0/14/b/1
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "That fantastic red shirt, by the way... maika'i loa."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_3/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Good to see you!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_3/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You ever move from that spot?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_3/0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure, why not."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_3/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Oh sure! Gotta leave to get snacks, after all."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_3/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "That's the spirit!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_3/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Koa stretches his arms out over the sides of the couch, smiling warmly at you. You're starting to get used to this routine."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_3/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let me guess... no talk, just vibes?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_3/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Looking forward to some quiet time together."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_3/0/g-0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I just know you're sitting on a juicy secret... spill it."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_3/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Me too!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_3/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Koa breathes in deeply, exhaling with an air of supreme happiness. With every passing moment, you feel yourself growing more relaxed—Koa truly has mastered the art of relaxation."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_3/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Your body and mind feel as though you've just spent the day at a luxury spa—you've never known anyone to have such an intensely calming effect on their environment."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_3/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "After an indeterminate amount of time, Koa finally breaks your comfortable silence."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_3/0/g-1/27
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Hey... I really needed this time. I wanted to say thank you in a way that only a couch can."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_3/0/g-1/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Some old chips and popcorn..?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_3/0/g-1/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Did you just give me trash?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_3/0/g-1/37/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "GIMME THE SNACKS"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_3/0/g-1/c-6/7 koa_couch/Koa_3/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Couch culture really values the little things that are left behind. This might look like old chips and popcorn to you..."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_3/0/g-1/c-6/15 koa_couch/Koa_3/0/g-1/c-7/15
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "But these things have been a part of me for years. When I give them to you I give you a piece of myself."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_3/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "It's among the highest honors my brethren can extend to anyone else."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_3/0/g-2/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow, I'm touched."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_3/0/g-2/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh... thanks... I guess..."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_3/0/g-2/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's pretty weird in human culture."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_3/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I'm glad you understand the value of this gift!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_3/0/g-2/c-10/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "You're welcome!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_3/0/g-2/c-11/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Dang! Good thing I'm not human then, wow!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_3/0/g-3/3
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I'm really glad we could share this time together. I'm gonna take SUCH a good nap now..."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_3/0/g-3/11
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Come back anytime you wanna share some quiet time, alright? I'm just... gonna..."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_3/0/0
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "You really want me to tell you a secret of mine?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_3/0/15/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Obviously."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_3/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's either that or sit around and blink at each other."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_3/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sorry... only if you want to!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_3/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Well then..."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_3/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_3/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I'd rather not... but you don't seem to appreciate the value of silence, so..."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_3/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Koa rubs at the back of his neck—he looks deeply uncomfortable."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_3/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Well... one time when I was a brand-new young couch at another house... my owners were having a party."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_3/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "My owner was supposed to propose to his girlfriend, but the ring box fell into the cushions."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_3/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I would normally just push it up to him, but I saw him talking to this other woman in the kitchen..."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_3/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "And then she kissed him, and he kissed her back..."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_3/0/g-0/40
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Koa falls silent, the memory of what he'd witnessed too upsetting to continue."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_3/0/g-0/48
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I just held onto it after that."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_3/0/g-0/56/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So you still have it?!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_3/0/g-0/57/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What happened to the ring!?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_3/0/g-0/58/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm so sorry to hear that..."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_3/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I held onto the ring until I moved in here. I.."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_3/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He looks deeply ashamed."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_3/0/g-1/19
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "It tumbled out of my cushions and got lost during the move."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_3/0/g-1/27/0
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I never told anyone about that before."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_3/0/g-1/27/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "See, don't you feel better?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_3/0/g-1/27/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thanks for trusting me with that."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_3/0/g-1/27/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't really see why... it's not all that juicy."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_3/0/g-1/27/c-6/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "...I think I feel worse."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_3/0/g-1/27/c-7/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "...sure. No problem."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_3/0/g-1/27/c-8/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I disappointed you after all that? What a bummer."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_3/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I need to just... not talk for a while."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_3/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Do whatever you want... just make yourself comfortable."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_3/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It's clear he doesn't mean it. You take your leave."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_4/0/6/b/1
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Ah. It's you. The talker. You here to get comfy or what?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_4/0/7/b/1
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Hey buddy! You here to get comfy?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_4/0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sure not here to get uncomfy."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_4/0/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You know it!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_4/0/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually I'm here for some hot goss from around the house!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_4/0/13/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's get back into exploring your past trauma about the ring. I can help you with it."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_4/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Boy do I hear that!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_4/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Right on buddy!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_4/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Koa smiles at you as you take your seat next to him. Once you're fully settled in, he closes his eyes, savoring the silence."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_4/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Time seems to slow down in Koa's sweet presence—talking just doesn't even seem like an option when the vibes are this good."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_4/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Just as you find yourself beginning to grow sleepy, Koa speaks."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_4/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "You really know how to share a vibe, buddy."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_4/0/g-0/35
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I got something for ya."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_4/0/g-0/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "...lint?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_4/0/g-0/44/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh hell yeah!!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_4/0/g-0/45/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Dolly? I'm literally in love with her!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_4/0/g-0/46/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What the hell?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_4/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Yeah!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_4/0/g-0/c-5/7 koa_couch/Koa_4/0/g-0/c-6/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "No problem!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_4/0/g-0/c-7/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "This is a big deal, I promise."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_4/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "When a couch gives you lint... it's like I'm giving you a piece of my own soul."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_4/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "It's really meaningful for a couch. To put it in a way you can understand..."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_4/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "It's kinda like a human giving another human a lock of their own hair."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_4/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I heard that's like, real big in human culture."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_4/0/g-1/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You heard wrong."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_4/0/g-1/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh yeah we <i>do</i> do that."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_4/0/g-1/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thanks for this piece of your soul, then."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_4/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I don't know, I heard it from a pretty reliable source on humans."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_4/0/g-1/c-8/15
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Tony knows all about that stuff and he'd never tell me something wrong!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_4/0/g-1/c-9/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Yeah, see? So you get it!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_4/0/g-1/c-10/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "You're so welcome buddy!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_4/0/g-2/3
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I'm just feeling so peaceful... you know a gift of lint from a couch is a big thing."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_4/0/g-2/11
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I feel like you know me that much better now."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_4/0/g-2/19
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I feel a post-gift nap coming... you take it easy, alright?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_4/0/0 koa_couch/koa_talk_4_trauma/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Koa looks genuinely pained."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_4/0/11
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Relaxing really isn't enough for you? You have to hear some gossip?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_4/0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I didn't come here to be bored."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_4/0/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Serve me up!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_4/0/21/s/0 koa_couch/koa_talk_4_trauma/0/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's what I said."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_4/0/koagossipjoin/0
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "...alright."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_4/0/koagossipjoin/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Koa pauses, closing his eyes as he thinks. Finally, he speaks, but he keeps his eyes closed."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_4/0/koagossipjoin/16
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I heard Dolly and Hoove had a falling out."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_4/0/koagossipjoin/27
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "She was telling her little pal Lint about it. Something about him going too hard vacuuming the carpet near the couch and messing up her place..."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_4/0/koagossipjoin/32
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "So, she's been staying under me for a little while."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_4/0/koagossipjoin/40
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "...I don't know, I couldn't hear the details of what she was sayin'. It's not really my business."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_4/0/koagossipjoin/48
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "...that's all I got for you."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_4/0/koagossipjoin/56/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Seriously?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_4/0/koagossipjoin/57/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Boooring!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_4/0/koagossipjoin/58/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thanks for the tip!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_4/0/koagossipjoin/c-3/7 koa_couch/koa_talk_4/0/koagossipjoin/c-4/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "...I understand. I'm not very good at gossip."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_4/0/g-0/0 koa_couch/koa_talk_4_trauma/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I don't feel much like talking anymore. You can stay if you want to..."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_4/0/g-0/8 koa_couch/koa_talk_4_trauma/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "But that's all I got."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_4/0/g-0/19 koa_couch/koa_talk_4_trauma/0/g-1/27
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Koa closes his eyes, shutting you out entirely."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_4_trauma/0/11
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "You wanna to help me with it?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_4_trauma/0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes. By talking it through I can help you."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_4_trauma/0/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh sorry... my bad. How about we stick to something lighter?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_4_trauma/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I'm not asking you for that."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_4_trauma/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "My past is for me, okay?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_4_trauma/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I may be a couch, but I don't want any therapist to go with me."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_4_trauma/0/g-0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But by unlocking this, I can get you to love me!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_talk_4_trauma/0/g-0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You might feel closed off, but it would be better if you were open."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_5/0/0/b/1
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I'm at my limit with you. Take a seat if you want."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_5/0/1/b/1
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Hmm... you again, huh? Take a seat."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_5/0/2/b/1
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Hey hey! Come on over and have a seat, buddy."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_5/0/5/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You look less sleepy than usual..."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_5/0/6/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Something on your mind?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_5/0/7/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Happy to!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_5/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Do I? Guess I got a lot to think about."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_5/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "A little... but nothing you need to worry about right now."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_5/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Awesome!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_5/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "It's a good day to spend some nice quiet time together, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_5/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just tell me whatever it is you've been waiting to tell me."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_5/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Isn't it always?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_5/0/g-0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If that's what you want let's do it."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_5/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "...I was going to get to it on my own time. But alright."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_5/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He sits up, his expression growing a bit more serious."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_5/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "It is..."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_5/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Koa tries to relax, but it doesn't seem to come to him today. He sighs, shaking his head."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_5/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Ah, who am I kidding... there's just too much on my mind."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_5/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Sorry to break the silence... but it's important."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_Finale/0
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "We've been hanging out a lot lately, and I'm glad it happened."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_Finale/8
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I've been having some trouble getting my mind around some things, and having you here, well..."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_Finale/16
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "It's just made some things real clear to me."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/Koa_Finale/24
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "So I hope you won't be upset with what I'm about to say."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_hate/0/0
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I just wanted to relax with someone who felt like I was enough."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_hate/0/8
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I honestly thought that someone could be you."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_hate/0/16
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "But you just couldn't respect my wishes."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_hate/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Your wishes were boring."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_hate/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But letting your feelings free is good for you..."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_hate/0/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well fuck you too, buddy."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_hate/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Yeah, I get that it's not for you."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_hate/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "But that's what I wanted."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_hate/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Maybe for you, but I needed the space to be myself."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_hate/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "And you couldn't do that for me."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_hate/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Why would you say that? I don't talk to you like that."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_hate/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "If you had heard me out and honored my wishes I might have been comfortable opening up to you."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_hate/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "But I couldn't possibly tell someone this careless my feelings about my pain."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_hate/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "This is your house. I'm still your couch."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_hate/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I can't stop you from hanging out here."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_hate/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "But me and you... there's nothing here anymore."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_hate/0/g-0/40
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Keep it comfy... but keep it away from me, alright buddy?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_hate/0/g-0/82
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Aw man... I wanted some more old receipts or literal dirt or some bullshit!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_hate/0/g-0/90
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "We are missing out on <w>NOTHING</w> with this snoozefest."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_friend/0/0
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "You know, the whole alone together thing can be real hard for some folks to grasp."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_friend/0/8
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "And I could tell you didn't always quite get it, but you tried for me, and I see that."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_friend/0/16
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "And that means a whole lot to me."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_friend/0/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I am definitely a big talker."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_friend/0/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're worth the effort!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_friend/0/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I appreciate your patience with me."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_friend/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Nothing wrong with that! As long as there's still space for quiet too."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_friend/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Thanks for saying so, buddy."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_friend/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "It's nothin'! You're worth it."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_friend/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "You don't need me to invite you into your own home, but listen:"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_friend/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "You're welcome anytime on this couch, buddy."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_friend/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Anytime you need someone to listen, I got you."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_friend/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "And anytime you wanna sit and just enjoy the silence..."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_friend/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I'll be right here."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_love/0/3
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I've got one last gift that I think will say it much better than I can."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_love/0/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Leftover sweets?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_love/0/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Garbage?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_love/0/13/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "CANDY ME UP BIG DADDY"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_love/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "See that one in the middle? The heart?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_love/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Can you read that for me?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_love/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "'I love you'?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_love/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "...you love me?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_love/0/g-0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I want you to read it."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_love/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "...'I love you.'"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_love/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "You dropped these. And I know it's a little too soon for love..."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_love/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "But you make me feel safe and happy. And as a couch, a gift like this means more than words."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_love/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I've been holding onto this hoping for the right time to give it to you."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_love/0/g-1/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thank you!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_love/0/g-1/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Eat the candies immediately.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_love/0/g-2/3
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "My previous owner... he used to talk non-stop."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_love/0/g-2/11
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "He never took a moment to relax. He was always on the phone, gabbin' away."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_love/0/g-2/19
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "It just made me nuts... I couldn't even hear myself think, you know?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_love/0/g-2/27
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I came to appreciate the silence all the more."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_love/0/g-2/35
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "The fact that you could respect my wishes every time I asked..."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_love/0/g-2/43
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "You really gave me the space to be me."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_love/0/g-2/51
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I've had so much on my mind lately, and your presence near me has just been such a blessing."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_love/0/g-2/59
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "You calmed my thoughts and let me sort through 'em."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_love/0/g-2/67
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "And with all that time to think... I know now that I just want to keep enjoying the silence with you."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_love/0/g-2/75
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "What do you say? You wanna keep doin' this with me?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_love/0/g-2/83/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I stale valentine heart you too, Koa."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_love/0/g-2/84/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure, but as friends."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_love/0/g-2/c-8/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "...that might be the nicest thing anyone's ever said to me."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_love/0/g-2/c-8/18
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Koa envelops you in his strong arms, wrapping you into a hug that feels like a sweet ocean breeze."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_love/0/g-2/c-8/26
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I'm the luckiest couch in the world. Wanna cuddle?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_love/0/g-2/c-8/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hell yeah."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_love/0/g-2/c-8/34/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Only cuddling?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_love/0/g-2/c-8/34/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No thanks."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_love/0/g-2/c-8/34/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You and Koa spend a pleasant time cuddled up in each other's arms—you had no idea your couch could be <i>this</i> comfortable."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_love/0/g-2/c-8/34/c-1/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Hey, if you want more... I'm into it."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_love/0/g-2/c-8/34/c-1/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Koa helps you take a comfortable seat in his lap... and while he normally enjoys the silence, one thing's for certain..."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_love/0/g-2/c-8/34/c-1/23
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When it comes to intimacy, he holds nothing back—vocally or otherwise."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_love/0/g-2/c-8/34/c-2/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "That's alright."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_love/0/g-2/c-8/34/c-2/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Koa releases you then, throwing his arm back over the back of the couch."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_love/0/g-2/c-8/34/c-2/23
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "This is the start of something real comfortable..."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_love/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Heck yeah, friends!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_love/0/g-2/c-9/15
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "As long as I got you in my life I know I'm really gonna be feelin' the peace."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_ed_love/0/g-2/c-9/23
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Thanks for keepin' it chill with me, buddy."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_love_return/0/0
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "This is so great... every time I see that smile... I can just feel the ocean breeze in my hair."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_love_return/0/8
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "You just make me feel so peaceful."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_love_return/0/16
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "You wanna get comfy?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_love_return/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You know I do!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_love_return/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm actually here to Realize you."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_love_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Comfy doesn't even begin to describe the feeling of love you have when you are with Koa."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_friend_return/0/0
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Hey there buddy! You wanna take a load off?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_friend_return/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm so ready to relax."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_friend_return/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm actually here to Realize you, Koa!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_friend_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I hear that! Come on over here."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_friend_return/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You relax and dream of cool ocean breezes with your friend Koa."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_hate_return/0/0
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Oh."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_hate_return/0/8
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Well, if you're here to take a seat, take a seat."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_hate_return/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "On you? In your dreams, couch potato."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_hate_return/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I can't take this anymore, Koa. I want to be friends. (USE EMPATHY CANDY)"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_hate_return/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "...oh, yes, please. I'm so tired of being sad when I see you."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_hate_return/0/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can we hug it out?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_hate_return/0/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's just be cool."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_hate_return/0/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Koa opens his massive arms to you, wrapping them around you. You breathe each other in, all the tension between you melting away."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_hate_return/0/c-1/15/c-0/18
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You're surprised when Koa speaks, though his voice is a sweet whisper."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_hate_return/0/c-1/15/c-0/26
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "...I'm so glad we can be pals again."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_hate_return/0/c-1/15/c-0/34
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Let's keep it chill from now on."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_hate_return/0/c-1/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Let's be cool!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_hate_return/0/c-1/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Come on over and rest, buddy."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_hate_return/0/c-1/15/c-1/23
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You take a seat next to Koa, and everything just feels right."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_hate_return/0/c-1/15/c-1/31
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "There's no more awkwardness, no more tension... just you, Koa, and sweet silence."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_realize_join/0/6
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Whoah... sweet!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_realize_join/0/14
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "You wanna do this now then?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_realize_join/0/31/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I do."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_realize_join/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sorry buddy, no can do."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_realize_join/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Oh hey, no problem. I can wait for ya!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_realize_return/0/0
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Hey buddy! You wanna relax? Or are we doin' that Realization thing?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_realize_return/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's Realization time!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_realize_return/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Relaxation time!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_realize_return/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "It's always a great time to relax!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_realize_begin/3/b/1
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "I thought I'd be so nervous to Realize something, but I'm just so relaxed with Koa here!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_realize_begin/6
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "C'mon Koa, hopefully Realization doesn't tucker you out too much!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_realize_begin/17
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The spectral energy flows through your dateviators, and what was once merely a couch, becomes...."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_realized/0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Koa looks over his body, marveling at the size and strength of it... the words don't seem to come. He looks to you, opening and closing his mouth a few times, before just shrugging."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_realized/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Welcome to humanity, Koa."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_realized/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're welcome."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_realized/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Thanks, buddy. I wasn't even trying to be quiet this time..."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_realized/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Some things are just beyond words."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_realized/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "There's so much this body can do... so many naps I could take in so many different places."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_realized/0/g-0/8/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Now that's what being human's all about."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_realized/0/g-0/8/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Your body can do so much more than just sleep, handsome."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_realized/0/g-0/8/c-2/7
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "I can't wait, wow! I'm gonna relax like no human being's ever relaxed before!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_realized/0/g-0/8/c-3/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Koa's smile is as sweet as ever, but his tone sends a shock of heat through you."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_realized/0/g-0/8/c-3/15
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Why do you think I nap so much? I save my energy for the things that matter..."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_love_divert/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Koa's comforting presence is remarkable in any other space, but when it's only the two of you it becomes something otherworldly."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_love_divert/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He takes his time with you, allowing you to dictate the pace and intensity of your lovemaking."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_love_divert/19
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Koa's relaxed persona remains, but as a lover he's as strong and steady as the waves pounding the shore."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_love_divert/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Considerate to the end, Koa ensures you're entirely satisfied before he allows sleep to overtake him in the aftermath."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_love_join/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Koa's long-held dream of napping in all sorts of different places leads him to purchase a furniture store, complete with a massive warehouse."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_love_join/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When you ask him where he found the funds for such an expensive undertaking, he cheerfully informs you that he's been saving the spare change that fell into his cushions for many, many years."
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_love_join/16
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "You wouldn't believe how much money people drop into their couch cushions over the years!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_love_join/24
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Thanks to your generous donations I'm gonna make my dreams come true!"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_love_join/32
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "...what do you mean those weren't donations?"
msgstr ""

#: koa_couch/koa_love_join/46
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "A couch's understanding of property law differs from those of humans, and by way of an apology Koa grants you free furniture for life—and every piece comes with a special Koa comfort guarantee."
msgstr ""
